# Royal Mix — Developer Testnet Guide

## Overview
This Testnet repository contains:
- Code skeletons for apps (Food, Health, Delivery, Supplier)
- API routes and controllers
- UI component placeholders
- Testnet configuration
- Mock data for testing
- Supplier system setup
- Rewards logic testing
- Multi-language support setup

## Folder Structure
- /apps/: Frontend modules
- /backend/api/: REST API skeleton
- /backend/config/: config.json for testnet
- /docs/: Architecture & Policies
- /ui/: Components + assets
- /scripts/: Mock data & setup scripts

## Testnet Notes
- Supabase not yet connected
- RLS policies not required yet
- API endpoints are skeletons
- Mock data used for testing
- Ready to switch to Mainnet in future
